title Vinyl Knock-knock: the Playback page where the launcher answers screen: the Knock-knock row (last, Off) and its sentence in the strip; a tap turns it On, Enter Off again (480x320 and 320x480 at their real density)
sizes 480x320 320x480
ppmm 630
# the 3.5-inch panel's 6.3 px/mm (the owner's rule R-4)
allow-small
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE playback
env VINYL_DEMO_SCREEN 1

wait 900
shot 01-playback-knock-off
expect text "Knock-knock"
expect text "Gapless"
tap "Knock-knock"
wait 400
shot 02-playback-knock-on
key enter
wait 400
shot 03-playback-knock-off-again
expect noquit
